WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.260 --> 00:00:07.319
Candidate Donald Trump told the American

00:00:07.319 --> 00:00:09.240
people he was going to move the US

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:11.309
Embassy in Israel from Tel Aviv to

00:00:11.309 --> 00:00:13.710
Jerusalem. But President Donald Trump –

00:00:13.710 --> 00:00:16.949
despite rumors – hasn't done the deed.

00:00:16.949 --> 00:00:18.960
Now, every Republican candidate has

00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:21.119
always promised to do this. None have ever

00:00:21.119 --> 00:00:21.869
done it.

00:00:21.869 --> 00:00:24.029
So are they rethinking putting the US

00:00:24.029 --> 00:00:26.369
embassy in Jerusalem, or are they just going

00:00:26.369 --> 00:00:28.560
slow on that? One reason the president

00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:30.420
may be hesitating is because of Israeli

00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:31.980
settlements policy to which he's

00:00:31.980 --> 00:00:34.710
expressed some small objection. Another

00:00:34.710 --> 00:00:36.329
reason may be that he just isn't sure

00:00:36.329 --> 00:00:37.620
how to do it.

00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:39.090
There's nothing really wrong with the

00:00:39.090 --> 00:00:41.430
idea: After all, West Jerusalem isn't

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:44.070
disputed territory. East Jerusalem is

00:00:44.070 --> 00:00:46.110
what the Palestinians claim. The real

00:00:46.110 --> 00:00:48.390
question here isn't where the embassy is.

00:00:48.390 --> 00:00:50.940
The real question is, "What is the basis

00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:52.680
for peace between the Israelis and the

00:00:52.680 --> 00:00:55.829
Palestinians?" The basis for peace is a

00:00:55.829 --> 00:00:58.800
partnership, not about where the

00:00:58.800 --> 00:01:01.469
different buildings are. Moving it isn't

00:01:01.469 --> 00:01:03.300
going to make all the difference. Having

00:01:03.300 --> 00:01:05.400
a Palestinian partner is.

00:01:07.160 --> 00:01:08.660
What do you think about moving the US

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:11.100
embassy from Tel Aviv to Jerusalem? Let us

00:01:11.100 --> 00:01:12.899
know in the comments, and also let us

00:01:12.899 --> 00:01:14.670
know what other topics you'd like AEI

00:01:14.670 --> 00:01:17.430
scholars to cover in 60 seconds.

